     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>When exporting lots of trees into a pdf file, one tree a page, how to adjust the height of different page. </div><div>Because of different number of taxa in trees, the figure generated by either the specified height or the default value of &quot;pdf()&quot; function in R</div><div>looks very bad. Any suggestion would be appreciated.</div><div><br></div><div>My code:</div><div><br></div><div><div>pdf(&quot;group_tree.pdf&quot;, onefile = T, width= 10, height = 14)</div><div># pdf(&quot;test-page-height.pdf&quot;, onefile= T)</div><div><br></div></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TREE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">sub</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;.*(arCOG\\\\d+)$&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;\\\\1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TREE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> perl</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  tree </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TREE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  tree </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fortify</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&lt;+%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> LS </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    geom_text2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">subset </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">isTip</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nudge_x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.015</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nudge_y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    geom_tiplab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    geom_point</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shape</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    scale_color_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> colorset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    scale_shape_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shapeset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    ggtitle</span><span style=\"color:#